    <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
          How does RFID self-checkout work for fashion retail?
          <span class="faq-icon"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Customers place items near the RFID antenna — the system detects every tagged item in seconds without barcode scanning or line-of-sight. Average transaction: 32 seconds vs. 85 seconds traditional (62% faster). Anti-bleed technology ensures only intended items register. This is critical for fashion retail where 30% of customers abandon checkout lines that exceed 10 minutes.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
          How does Teamwork handle the high return rates in fashion?
          <span class="faq-icon"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>30–40% of online fashion purchases are returned. Teamwork's BORIS (Buy Online Return In Store) processes cross-channel returns and restocks inventory the moment an item comes back — available for the next walk-in shopper right away, with no sync lag and no manual reconciliation. 84% of shoppers are more likely to repurchase if returns are easy, and 89% stop buying after a difficult return experience.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
          How quickly can we deploy to new stores or markets?
          <span class="faq-icon"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Reiss deployed across U.S. stores and City Beach expanded across Australia using Teamwork's mobile POS. The iOS interface reduces training to under 30 minutes. The platform is localized in 40+ countries with native fiscal compliance — so entering Paris, Sydney, or Mexico City requires no platform change, no regional vendor, and no re-training.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
          How does Teamwork Commerce compare to Shopify POS or NewStore for fashion?
          <span class="faq-icon"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Shopify POS is built for e-commerce first — its in-store capabilities are secondary and it lacks native RFID. NewStore focuses on mobile-first associate experience but doesn't offer native RFID self-checkout or end-to-end RFID inventory. Teamwork Commerce combines <a href="/platform/rfid/" style="color: var(--brand-text);">native RFID</a> (32s self-checkout, 99.9% inventory accuracy), <a href="/platform/oms/" style="color: var(--brand-text);">enterprise OMS with Endless Aisle</a>, global fiscal compliance in 40+ countries, and the full omnichannel stack (BOPIS, BORIS, ship-from-store) in one platform.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
          Which fashion brands use Teamwork Commerce?
          <span class="faq-icon"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>City Beach (Australia), Reiss (UK/US expansion), LA Apparel, and 260 Sample Sale. The platform also serves luxury fashion brands including Acne Studios, Amiri, and The Row. It's localized in 40+ countries with native iOS POS, end-to-end RFID, and integrated OMS.</p></div>
